<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 1-, 4-week discount T-bills May 2.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 1-, 4-week discount T-bills May 2.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer two discount T-bill issues with maturities of one and four weeks with no minimum acceptable prices set in advance at auctions today, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The issues will be offered with par value of 12 billion levs for the one-week T-bills and 45 billion levs for the four-week ones.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3031197000     BG3031297008</p>
<p> Term		     one week	   four weeks</p>
<p> Par value		12 bln levs	45 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	   May 2		May 2</p>
<p> Issue date	     May 5		May 5</p>
<p> Maturity date	  May 12	     June 2</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
